# NetBee OS - WAN Hotplug Hook
# Built-in RPi 5 RP1 Ethernet (macb=y) always probes first as eth0 (LAN),
# while external USB/PCIe NICs load as modules (=m) for eth1 (WAN).
# Trigger vnstat & offload/SQM automatically if eth1 is hotplugged after boot.
SUBSYSTEM=="net", ACTION=="add", KERNEL=="eth1", RUN+="/usr/sbin/netbee-hotplug-wan"
